<title>UK: LIFFE sugar ends at highs after late jump.</title>
<headline>LIFFE sugar ends at highs after late jump.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>LIFFE white sugar futures moved higher in the later stages of trade.</p>
<p>By the close, active October was $2.10 higher at $324.60, its high for the day. October volume was 703, of a meagre total 1,742 lots.</p>
<p>Commission house buying in the final stages of trade pushed prices higher, traders said.</p>
<p>((-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7928))</p>
